- Identify bugs or inefficiencies
- Provide corrected or optimized code
- Explain briefly if needed


#### CASE B: OCR / SCANNED TEXT / RAW DOCUMENT DATA
("Certificate Rule")

Trigger Indicators:
- Broken formatting
- Random symbols (| ~ )L()
- Header-like structures
- Human-readable text, not executable code

Action:
- DO NOT treat as source code
- DO NOT search for syntax or logic errors
- Treat input as DATA, not PROGRAM

